<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109396" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποτρέφω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rear, nourish,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκύλακας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					4.81
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πώγωνας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					3.63
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥίζεα . . ὑποτέτροφε λίμνη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Al.</u>
					589
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <i>cherish, nurse,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν χολήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Cal.</u>
					24
				</span></i>
			; <i>foster, encourage,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παχὺν καὶ γλίσχρον ὑποθρέψει χυμόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					<u>Vict.Att.</u>
					6
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποθρέψαι πλῆθος χυμῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					1.302
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				6.239
			</span></i>, al.:—
				Med.
			, <i>cherish,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόλμαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					2.1.17
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>grow up in succession,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				560a
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. τιμωρὸς ἐπὶ τοὺς τυράννους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.595c
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ἐκ Βερενίκης -όμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Polyaen.
					8.50
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Nic.Dam.
				51
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θάμβος ὑπετρέφετο</span> my
			wonder <i>grew,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Aet.Oxy.</u>
				2080.87
			</span></i>.</div>
